# Bartenders Don't Panic — Privacy Policy

**Effective date:** November 3, 2026
**Developer:** AxiomaraGames
**Contact:** [your contact email]

Bartenders Don't Panic ("the app") is a cocktail recipe app. This policy explains what information the app handles, and the licences of the software and fonts it is built with.

## Summary

The app does not collect, transmit, sell or share any personal data. Everything you enter stays on your device.

## Information the app stores on your device

To work, the app saves the following, **only on your device**:

- **My Bar:** the ingredients you mark as owned
- **Favorites:** the drinks you save
- **Shopping list:** the ingredients you add to it
- **Settings:** your choice of units (metric or US) and that you have confirmed you are of legal drinking age

This information is never sent to us or to anyone else. It is deleted when you uninstall the app or clear its data in your device's settings.

**Device backups:** if you have turned on Android's backup feature, Android may include the app's data in your device backup, stored in your Google account under Google's own privacy terms. We have no access to these backups.

## What the app does not do

- It does not ask you to create an account or sign in.
- It does not connect to the internet. All 640 recipes and their photos are built into the app.
- It does not collect analytics, crash reports, location, contacts or device identifiers.
- It does not show ads and contains no advertising or tracking software.
- It does not use your camera, microphone or files.

## Age requirement

The app contains information about alcoholic drinks and is intended only for adults of legal drinking age in their country (18 or older, or 21 in countries where that is the legal age). The app asks you to confirm your age before you can use it. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone, including children, because we collect no information at all.

## Responsible drinking

Please drink responsibly and never drink and drive. The app's alcohol-free drinks are a good choice for designated drivers and anyone not drinking.

## Changes to this policy

If this policy changes, the new version will be published at this address with a new effective date. Because the app collects no data, any change will not affect information you have already given us.

